is a laboratory experiment on hapless slimes. Go classic in Deathmatch and Team Deathmatch, hog the ball in Murderball, dodge the clock in Hot Potato, fight over the single loaded Golden Gun, race through grapple gauntlets in Waypoint Race, or sink trick shots in the chaotic basketball mode Slimeball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215680/extras/4352ae6cf30b2f2a06843f1d20399d3e.avif?t=1787890854\" alt=\"Spice it up with Modifiers\" width=690 height=345 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bend the rules with stackable modifiers that turn any round into a highlight reel. Float through low gravity, ricochet bouncing bullets off every wall, supersize your projectiles, drop the lights and survive by muzzle flash, or hand the dice to Random Modifiers and let the lab decide. Mix and match for endless mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215680/extras/e19bfbda3a2c6866fb47c2d618039d9d.poster.avif?t=1787890854\" width=720 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215680/extras/e19bfbda3a2c6866fb47c2d618039d9d.webm?t=1787890854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215680/extras/e19bfbda3a2c6866fb47c2d618039d9d.mp4?t=1787890854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215680/extras/4ed18521ed1af2f71dd97b1d6589fab8.avif?t=1787890854\" alt=\"Escape the Lab Together\" width=690 height=345 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Team up for a co-op campaign that drops you and your friends inside Helix Ward-9, a strange research facility with a story it would rather you didn't uncover. Hunt for keycards, unlock new weapons as you go, and fight your way toward the exit. It's a tight, focused adventure designed to be played shoulder-to-shoulder - the same chaotic co-op energy as the rest of the game, with a few secrets buried in the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215680/extras/ce61a403e8bc8ea267420434dba0f3cd.poster.avif?t=1787890854\" width=692 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215680/extras/ce61a403e8bc8ea267420434dba0f3cd.webm?t=1787890854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215680/extras/ce61a403e8bc8ea267420434dba0f3cd.mp4?t=1787890854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215680/extras/a69c8e1bdefaf40c57633f6903743c69.avif?t=1787890854\" alt=\"An Arsenal of Absurd Experiments\" width=690 height=345 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with weapons spanning every technological era, from baseball bats and rapiers to shotguns, railguns, gravity tools and gleefully oversized ordnance. Each one throws, recalls, launches or fires differently, so picking up the right tool at the right moment is half the fun. <br> <br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 18-player local multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Remote Play Together support (4 players max)</p></li><l